    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5fca89892730d8007611d907",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Benjamin Armintor",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca89892730d8007611d907",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This is becoming an issue at work, as there is a desire for a new CMS to have access to objects in Fedora.  I'm not sure what the right preposition is here (\"JSR 170 in Fedora\" or \"JSR 170 on Fedora\"), but I'll try to update the comments as I get a clearer picture.  There are some readily available analogies, although it touches on other questions in the 3.x community (e.g., whether datastreams are \"first class\" DO's or not).</p>",
     "created": "28/Jan/10 12:04 PM",
     "id": "11222",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10090/comment/11222",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "5fca89892730d8007611d907",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Benjamin Armintor",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca89892730d8007611d907",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "28/Jan/10 12:04 PM"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5fca89892730d8007611d907",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Benjamin Armintor",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca89892730d8007611d907",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Focusing on the repository model:<br/>\nNodes and nodeType:<br/>\nThere is a strong affinity of JCR nodeType to Fedora Content Model, although the former requires an inheritance structure that is not currently supported in the CMA (although Asger's ECM-related work touches on it; see the thread at:<br/>\n <a href=\"https://fedora-commons.org/confluence/spaces/viewthread.action?key=DEV&amp;id=13140053\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora-commons.org/confluence/spaces/viewthread.action?key=DEV&amp;id=13140053</a><br/>\n).  Digital Objects and Datastreams both probably model as nodes.  The notion of primary typing of a JCR node doesn't immediately translate to the Fedora CMA.</p>\n\n<p>UUID's could be built in as an auxiliary to, or replacement for, PIDs, particularly if pid generation were modularized.</p>\n\n<p>Properties:<br/>\nJCR nodeProperties correspond to a number of entities in Fedora: Datastreams, RELS-EXT triples, and system properties to name a few.  The parent-child organizational properties might be modelled as RELS-EXT/INT relationships (again, ECM has something to say to this), but there's no explicit action on such properties in Fedora.</p>\n\n<p>Workspaces:<br/>\nBecause the relationships in Fedora all exist in the same graph, I don't immediately see a way to have a Fedora repository act as multiple workspaces without a very awkward translation of organizational relationships to DO's in their own right, or a change to the way that DO's are serialized.</p>",
     "created": "29/Jan/10 3:21 PM",
     "id": "11225",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10090/comment/11225",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "5fca89892730d8007611d907",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bf2e136284e0b17b99502dc3a32eef38?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBA-6.png",
